{"4957450": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "A Wee Flee", "steam_appid": 4957450, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A Wee Flee is a couch co-op puzzle game where the players solve puzzles set in different rooms of a dollhouse. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The dollhouse was gifted to a little girl by her grandmother, but she did not treat its dolls very well. Now, the dolls try to make their way through the tricky dollhouse – in an attempt to escape their cruel owner. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each doll has unique abilities and players must use them to solve puzzles and help each other. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The escape will not be easy, as each room brings new challenges. Communication is a must if they want to complete their mission and finally be free. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key Features</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Couch co-op gameplay designed for two players.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve tricky puzzles using each doll’s unique abilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mechanics that are gradually introduced and combined in new ways.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Communication-focused gameplay where teamwork is essential.</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A Wee Flee is a couch co-op puzzle game where the players solve puzzles set in different rooms of a dollhouse. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The dollhouse was gifted to a little girl by her grandmother, but she did not treat its dolls very well. Now, the dolls try to make their way through the tricky dollhouse – in an attempt to escape their cruel owner. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each doll has unique abilities and players must use them to solve puzzles and help each other. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The escape will not be easy, as each room brings new challenges. Communication is a must if they want to complete their mission and finally be free. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key Features</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Couch co-op gameplay designed for two players.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve tricky puzzles using each doll’s unique abilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mechanics that are gradually introduced and combined in new ways.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Communication-focused gameplay where teamwork is essential.</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Solve together. Escape together. Survive together.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4957450/d7b6927c4425a7fa0a2b3008c4d41bccf46b8888/header.jpg?t=1786998282", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4957450/62d0d275c6afe7c31a1eeead12493a7a4fac021a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1786998282", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4957450/62d0d275c6afe7c31a1eeead12493a7a4fac021a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1786998282", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 or higher<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3-6100 / AMD FX-8350<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GTX 1060 / AMD RX 580<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 or higher (64 bit)<br></li><li><strong>